{"version":1,"content":"<p>提起超聲檢查，最讓人頭疼的兩件事莫過於必須跑一趟醫院，以及要在皮膚上塗滿冰涼濕滑的凝膠。遺憾的是，這兩點目前都不可或缺，不過這種局面也許不會持續太久了。科學家近日研發出一種乾式聚合物，有望讓可穿戴超聲設備成為現實。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1588314.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T08:03:53.308561+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T07:41:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T07:57:15.485452+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T07:57:15.485452+00:00","content_hash":"e84a2d5f2b0989e25486bb0f616d077c3ca18ae4a757368e3b0712bebfddeec6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}